ly SF-APPA-058: Season stability of top suppressors and negative teammate pairs", "score": 0.278, "reached_via": ["request matches the question or hypothesis of FAM:SF-APPA-058 (0.17)", "FAM:SF40 auto_related_family (record_link_related_to) FAM:SF-APPA-058"], "attributes": {"observed_research_question": "Season stability of top suppressors and negative teammate pairs", "auto_outcome_status": "rejected", "observed_hypothesis": "Each star's top sequential suppressor is stable across seasons, and some teammate X->Y sequences have large negative premiums.", "observed_result": "2/30 (7%) stable (>=75% same top suppressor): D. Mitchell PUTBACK 75%, L. James POST_UP 75%. Negative: J. Tatum->K. Porzingis DRIVE->SPOT_UP -0.444 n=31; Giannis->Lillard DRIVE->PNR -0.263 n=31; J. Brown->J. Tatum SPOT_U [cut; read_family for the full text]", "auto_failure_mechanism": "B_powered_null (adequately powered null result)", "observed_failure_evidence": "Only 2/30 stars meet the 75% same-top-suppressor stability rule.", "observed_sample_and_power": "30 stars x 4 seasons; min n=20/cell", "auto_validation_status": "no_validation_recorded; evidence: NOT_RECORDED", "observed_verdict": "null"}, "relationships": [{"rel": "auto_limited_by", "node": "LIM:small_sample"}, {"rel": "auto_has_risk", "node": "RISK:SAMPLE_SIZE_POWER"}]}], "n_results": 4}

Stage 2. Using the retrieval result above (follow-up tools are allowed within the tool budget), complete steps 4 to 9
and reply with the final action. Output schema (all fields required):
{
 "research_concepts": [
  "concept"
 ],
 "methodological_questions": [
  "question"
 ],
 "historical_evidence": [
  {
   "id": "identifier of a record returned by a tool",
   "status_as_recorded": "outcome status exactly as stated in the record (supported | rejected | inconclusive | untestable | artifact | not a hypothesis test | no result recorded)",
   "finding": "what the record states, in its own terms"
  }
 ],
 "failed_approaches": [
  {
